{
  "_comment": "Overlay (color-gel stacking 'Gels/Stack') screenshot capture. 60-level CAMPAIGN (valid loadLevel indices 0-59, display level = idx+1). Themes applied via window._applyAT(id,midnight) which writes Overlay's real theme palette to PIPE_COLORS + the --c1/--c2/--c3 CSS vars + midnight body chrome. Each slot picks a distinct level AND a distinct theme so all 11 store slots differ. Non-gameplay screens distributed once: Themes panel -> phone 06. Phone ships 7, tablets ship 2 each (01_deep + 02_early), all gameplay.",
